        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "v(x,t)=\n",
        "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\n",
        "B_n e^{-a^2\\left(\\frac{n\\pi}{L}\\right)^2 t}\n",
        "\\sin\\left(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}\\right)\n",
        "$$\n",
